  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844299726518091776/1046342916349632563/Ore_Variants.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844299726518091776/920398251490963506/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"321\" height=\"110\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Этот ресурс-пак добавляет больше разнообразия в руды<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Мне всегда казалось, что одинаковая текстура у каждой руды на каждом блоке — это довольно скучно, поэтому я решил что-то с этим сделать.<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Но зачем? </em>Мне просто было нечем заняться.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844299726518091776/920398251671314482/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"321\" height=\"110\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Больше никаких планов поддерживать моды, которые не работают на 1.19.2+; обновите свою игру, ребята.</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844299726518091776/920428591894888478/unknown.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"110\"><br></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Oh The Biomes You'll Go </em>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>BetterNether </em>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>)</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">BetterEnd (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend-forge-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Cinderscapes (</em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><em>)<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Universal Ores (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-ores-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>)<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Quark (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Enderscape (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/Minecraft/Mc-mods/enderscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>)<br>Paradise Lost (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paradise-lost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>)<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Randomite Classic (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomite-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Shret Nether (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shretnether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Druidcraft (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/druidcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">Caves and Cliffs Backport (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Gems and Crystals (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-and-crystals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric &amp; Forge</a>)<br>More Ore Stones (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mores-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mores-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)</span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\"><br>Create (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Oreganized (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Stalwart Dungeons (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)</span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\"><br>Galosphere (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Sully's Mod (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sullys-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Froge</a>)<br>LieOnLion's Enderite (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">The Aether (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Deeper Nether Biomes (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeper-nether-biomes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Infernal Expansion (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infernal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Deeper and Darker (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Оба</a>)<br>Sulfur and Potassium - More Gunpowder (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sulfur-and-potassium-make-more-gunpowder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Deep Aether (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Forge</strong></span>)<br>The Aether: Redux (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Ancient Aether (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br>Alex's Caves (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>)<br></span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Не относится к какой-либо конкретной категории, но если вам нужны варианты руд, которые выглядят круче, обязательно взгляните на&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spryzeens-ore-glint\" rel=\"nofollow\">пакет Spryzeen's Ore Glint</a>!</span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">В любом случае... эм, приятного просмотра!</span></p>",
